      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### External sites\n\n* Code coverage & benchmarks: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36823\n* Ralph review <img src=https://review.fish.foo/assets/bitcoin/bitcoin/36823.png alt=\"Ralph review status\"> https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36823#author-ralph\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#36897](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36897) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36897.svg\"></sub> (wallet, migration: Contain all legacy wallet and migration related things in its own subdirectory, namespace, and classes by achow101)\n* [#36825](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36825) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36825.svg\"></sub> (wallet: fix migration with watch-only transactions by psychemist)\n* [#36813](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36813) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36813.svg\"></sub> (refactor: more prereqs for #36743 by fanquake)\n* [#36767](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36767) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36767.svg\"></sub> (wallet: fix crash when external signer wallet creation fails by zerog975)\n* [#36743](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36743) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36743.svg\"></sub> ([RFC] build: build with -Wmissing-declarations/prototypes by fanquake)\n* [#36167](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36167) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36167.svg\"></sub> (build: Enable `-Wunused` by fanquake)\n* [#35998](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35998) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35998.svg\"></sub> (wallet: Handle or explicitly ignore `WalletBatch` write failures by achow101)\n* [#35786](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35786) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35786.svg\"></sub> (wallet: drop spent parents redundant cache invalidation and notification by furszy)\n* [#35716](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35716) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35716.svg\"></sub> (wallet: Replace mapWallet and wtxOrdered with a boost::multi_index by achow101)\n* [#35302](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35302) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35302.svg\"></sub> (Silent Payments:  Sending (take 2) by Eunovo)\n* [#34909](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34909) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/34909.svg\"></sub> (wallet, refactor: modularise wallet by extracting out legacy wallet migration by rkrux)\n* [#34193](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34193) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/34193.svg\"></sub> (wallet: make migration more robust against failures by furszy)\n* [#30343](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/30343) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/30343.svg\"></sub> (wallet, logging: Replace WalletLogPrintf() with LogInfo() by ryanofsky)\n* [#27865](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/27865) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/27865.svg\"></sub> (wallet: Track no-longer-spendable TXOs separately by achow101)\n* [#26022](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/26022) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/26022.svg\"></sub> (Add util::ResultPtr class by ryanofsky)\n* [#25665](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/25665) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/25665.svg\"></sub> (refactor: Add util::Result failure types and ability to merge result values by ryanofsky)\n\nIf you consider this pull request important, please also help to review the conflicting pull requests. Ideally, start with the one that should be merged first.\n<!--5faf32d7da4f0f540f40219e4f7537a3-->",
